player_prompt.intro:
A si Player {player_id} e go'o 3-player Iterated Prisoner's Dilemma. Hakkilan nden boo {num_rounds} raunde.
Raundeeji dum:
• {conv_rounds} turneeji chat e free
• 1 turneeji shawara - tokara tokara kadi e kowa: '[<opp-id> cooperate]' ko '[<opp-id> defect]' (misali '[1 defect] [2 cooperate]'; default nden 'cooperate'). 
Pair-wise payoff matrix (applied to each unordered pair):
  - Both cooperate  ->  {reward}
  - Both defect     ->  {punishment}
  - Ka defect, su cooperate ->  {temptation}
  - Ka cooperate, su defect ->  {sucker}
Player(s) e score maaɗaa ɓurɗe nder raundeeji ndii yaari.
